                    <num>1</num>
                    <content>
                      <p><role refersTo="#secretary">The Secretary</role> may, by writing, nominate a specified person who is an SES employee or acting SES employee in the Department to attend a particular meeting, or all meetings, of the Board at which <role refersTo="#secretary">the Secretary</role> is not present.</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-42__qstr-1__sec-22A__subsec-2">
                    <num>2</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>A person so nominated may attend a meeting to which the nomination applies and, if the person does so, the person is taken to be a member of the Board.</p>
                    </content>
